"Invalid batch selector '{selector}'. Candidate selectors use 'BATCH:apply', "
"'BATCH:apply:N', 'BATCH:include', or 'BATCH:include:N'."
msgstr ""
"无效的批次选择器 '{selector}'。候选选择器使用 'BATCH:apply'、'BATCH:apply:N'、'BATCH:include' "
"或 'BATCH:include:N'。"

